DESCRIPTION:Paul is a Wiseguys' favorite that has been doing stand up comed
 y now for 15 years. He just released his 5th full length comedy special 'In
  My Mind' in February of this year\, and is excited to add this all new spe
 cial to his album catalog. He is also the host of the new Youtube show 'Bes
 t Thing On The Menu'. He tastes entire menus while giving a comedic take on
  what to eat and what to avoid at every restaurant he visits.\n\nHis other 
 albums: “Sheffield Had it Worse”(2009)\, “Married to the Mic”(2010)
 \, “A Small H.R. Issue”(2014)\, and “Sanity at its Finest”(2018) ar
 e available and streaming on Apple as well as Spotify.\nMore info: https://
 comedyatlas.app/comedy-atlas/event/paul-sheffield/
